# ─── Hill climber progress / checkpoint files ────────────────────────────────
# These are large, ephemeral, and regenerated on every run.
# The MASTER_TRACKER.md is the canonical record of results.
data/gpu_hill_*.txt
data/gpu_hill_*.json
data/gpu_hill_checkpoint_*.json
data/decode_best_*.txt
data/*_hillclimb_results.txt
data/*_refine_results.txt
data/*_seeded_refine.txt
data/*_offset_results.txt
data/*_targeted_map_applied.txt
data/*_candidates.txt
data/*_candidate_processed.txt
data/p24_candidates_processed/
data/p24_prime0_post.txt
data/p24_candidate_full_*.txt

# ─── Intermediate analysis / solver output ───────────────────────────────────
