# ─── Archived hill-climb outputs that were never committed (Stage E, 2026-09-29) ─
# Kept locally for history; they were computed on misaligned page data. See the archive README.
data/archive/hillclimbers/*/untracked/

# ─── Solution monitoring output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
data/hillclimb_monitor_*.json
data/per_page_solutions/

# ─── Large reference files (keep tracked but note size) ──────────────────────
# data/corpora/emerson_essays.txt  # 564 KB — keep tracked
# data/corpora/wordlist.txt        # 4 MB — keep tracked
# reference/sources/LiberPrimus.pdf # 55 MB — consider LFS

# ─── Local agent / MCP config — CONTAINS CREDENTIALS, NEVER COMMIT ────────────
# .claude/mcp.vscode-reference.json holds bearer tokens. Tracked agent files: AGENTS.md,
# CLAUDE.md and .claude/skills/ (the skills this repo enables). Everything else under
# .claude/, agent memory and local agent config stay in this checkout.
.mcp.json
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/build-run/
!.claude/skills/debug-errors/
!.claude/skills/git-github/
